          "title": "Where Is It?: vocabulary",
          "explanation": "Learn ten useful words for saying where things are. Listen to each British English model and repeat it.",
          "patterns": [
            {
              "label": "Say where something is",
              "pattern": "The + object + is + place word + the + place.",
              "examples": [
                "The ball is in the box.",
                "The book is on the table.",
                "The cat is under the chair."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "tip": "Escucha, repite y fíjate en la frase completa. Usa el modelo para crear tu propia frase."
        },
